# Development Workflow & Common Tasks

## Quick Start Commands

### Generate Training Data
```bash
# Small test dataset
python test_size_limited_data.py

# Production datasets (100, 500, 1000 examples)
python generate_large_dataset.py
```

### Run Evaluations
```bash
# Test with Gemini 2.5 Flash
python -m eval.eval --data data/fs_training_small.jsonl --models gemini-2.5-flash --max-examples 10

# Test with multiple models
python -m eval.eval --data data/fs_training_medium.jsonl --models gemini-2.5-flash,qwen3-4b --max-examples 50
```

### Run Tests
```bash
# All tests (mocked for speed)
python -m pytest src/ -v

# Specific test files
python -m pytest src/fs_state_test.py -v
```

